# Frontend (apps/front)

Read **`.agents/skills/geist-design/SKILL.md`** (UI work) and **`.agents/skills/nuxt/SKILL.md`** (framework).

- Use `@nuxt/ui` primitives before custom markup; extend `app/components/s/` (`SCard`, `SRail`, …) when repeating patterns.
- All user strings in `i18n/locales/en-US.json` + `fr-FR.json`; links via `$localePath()`.
- Navigation: `NuxtLink` / `ULink`, not buttons. Persist filters/tabs in URL query.
- Design every state: empty, loading, error. Keyboard + `:focus-visible`. Button keeps label while loading.
- API: `$fetch` to `runtimeConfig.public.apiBase` with `credentials: 'include'`.
- Toasts: specific outcome, no trailing period (see geist-design copy rules).

Details: `.agents/skills/geist-design/AGENTS.md`, `references/nuxt-sarpbc.md`
